":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityCustomContent(_:_:importance:)-99n7k":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilitycustomcontent(_:_:importance:)-99n7k","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityCustomContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI29AccessibilityCustomContentKeyV","text":"AccessibilityCustomContentKey"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV","text":"Text"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"importance"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)AXCustomContent","text":"AXCustomContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@E@AXCustomContentImportance","text":"Importance"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","text":"ModifiedContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"accessibilityCustomContent(_:_:importance:)","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documenta